  "Description": {
    "Cost": 1428126,
    "UIName": "Charger",
    "Id": "chassisdef_charger_CGR-SA5",
    "Name": "Charger",
    "Details": "A variant of the Charger that took the 1A5 variant to its logical conclusion with new technologies, the SA5 was powered by a 320-rated Light Fusion Engine, giving it a speed of 64.8 km/h, while a MASC system was added allowing the 'Mech to reach speeds of 86.4 km/h in short bursts. The 'Mech was also built on an Endo Steel chassis to save even more weight. The SA5 carried an LB-X Autocannon/20 as its primary weapon. This was backed up by three ER Medium Lasers and two Streak SRM-6 launchers. The 'Mech was protected by fifteen and a half tons of armor.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Barrel Fist</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.14</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limit: Left Lower</color>",
